43625349}\n\ud83d\udd25Duel your friends in fun free-for-all matches, stay connected with built-in voice chat, and enjoy weekly updates with new tweaks, improvements, and surprises to keep the arena fresh and evolving.\n{1204911691799635}", "short_description": "Enter a fast-paced FFA arena where five elemental classes collide: \u2622\ufe0fToxic, \ud83d\udca5Blast, \ud83d\ude08Dark, \ud83d\udca8Wind, and \ud83e\udea8Earth. Each class brings distinct abilities, movement, and combat styles, creating constant chaos and counterplay.  No teams, no mercy\u2014outplay, outmaneuver, and dominate the arena to prove which element reigns supreme."}]}, "developer_name": "Iced Artisan Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vRd76WYN8Usj5zEYZFyQ3EbH5sqzx-j0XJojJ1OGUHPvdvCYAhdSJQo4BJDxapvdI65t_JKyX9OOWdm/pub", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Iced Artisan Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://linktr.ee/sonalegends", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "25410500205274086"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822968_889244323449900_8595058784170416754_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zET6KyJKPv4Q7kNvwHXrwl9&_nc_oc=Adp3Dry7l5XctSrgM